Upstream-Name: plasma-login-manager
Upstream-Contact: KDE Plasma Developers <plasma-devel@kde.org>
Source: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-login-manager
Comment:
 Upstream source is taken from the official KDE release tarballs published at
 https://download.kde.org/stable/plasma/ — not from a git checkout, because the
 git repository does not carry the po/ directory. KDE injects translations when
 the release tarball is generated, so a git build produces an English-only
 greeter.

